{
  "mn48:0.1": "Majjhima Nikāya 48 ",
  "mn48:0.2": "Kosambiyasutta ",
  "mn48:1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
  "mn48:1.2": "ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā kosambiyaṁ viharati ghositārāme. ",
  "mn48:2.1": "Tena kho pana samayena kosambiyaṁ bhikkhū bhaṇḍanajātā kalahajātā vivādāpannā aññamaññaṁ mukhasattīhi vitudantā viharanti. ",
  "mn48:2.2": "Te na ceva aññamaññaṁ saññāpenti na ca saññattiṁ upenti, na ca aññamaññaṁ nijjhāpenti, na ca nijjhattiṁ upenti. ",
  "mn48:3.1": "Atha kho aññataro bhikkhu yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā bhagavantaṁ abhivādetvā ekamantaṁ nisīdi. Ekamantaṁ nisinno kho so bhikkhu bhagavantaṁ etadavoca: ",
  "mn48:3.2": "“idha, bhante, kosambiyaṁ bhikkhū bhaṇḍanajātā kalahajātā vivādāpannā aññamaññaṁ mukhasattīhi vitudantā viharanti, te na ceva aññamaññaṁ saññāpenti, na ca saññattiṁ upenti, na ca aññamaññaṁ nijjhāpenti, na ca nijjhattiṁ upentī”ti. ",
  "mn48:4.1": "Atha kho bhagavā aññataraṁ bhikkhuṁ āmantesi: ",
  "mn48:4.2": "“ehi tvaṁ, bhikkhu, mama vacanena te bhikkhū āmantehi: ",
  "mn48:4.3": "‘satthā vo āyasmante āmantetī’”ti. ",
  "mn48:4.4": "“Evaṁ, bhante”ti kho so bhikkhu bhagavato paṭissutvā yena te bhikkhū tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā te bhikkhū etadavoca: ",
  "mn48:4.5": "“satthā āyasmante āmantetī”ti. ",
  "mn48:4.6": "“Evamāvuso”ti kho te bhikkhū tassa bhikkhuno paṭissutvā yena bhagavā tenupasa�